&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our London office with a &lt;strong&gt;hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; setup, typically 3 days in the office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive technical execution&lt;/strong&gt; by designing, building, and scaling backend services and frontend components that handle high-traffic workloads (20krpm and above).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead architectural improvements&lt;/strong&gt; and code reviews, ensuring the efficiency, visibility, and operational health of your team&#39;s systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
