&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills - simply comfortable in all scenarios with a polish to represent Taboola at the highest level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and questioning skills are essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The will and ability to work in a fast-paced, ever-evolving environment&lt;/li&gt;
